=== 4. Momentum vs base MA(20/60) on REGIME_DEPENDENT assets ===
Momentum: long the previous 5-day return, hold 1 day, daily rebalanced. Params: walk-forward per segment train=252d / test=84d / warmup=60d / overlap=60d, min 400 bars/segment, compared vs coin-flip null on the same segments

Segments: 4 contiguous blocks by date, past-only volatility classifier (turbulent = block median trailing-60-bar realized vol > series-wide median)

