    NVDA  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[-0.038, +0.013, +0.100] dispersion=+0.057 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
    TSLA  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.132, +0.016, +0.107] dispersion=+0.050 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
